eduroam-goe-linux
=================

This software is a modified version (a Go port) of the eduroam CAT Linux
installer generated by the GÉANT eduroam Configuration Assistant Tool (CAT),
https://github.com/GEANT/CAT, file devices/linux/Files/main.py. The original
installer for the University of Göttingen profile is included in this
repository as eduroam-linux-University_Goettingen-University_of_Gottingen.py.


NOTICE OF MODIFICATION (licence clause 7.2)
-------------------------------------------

The Original Work has been modified by Sepehr Rajabi (2026):

  * re-implemented in the Go programming language;
  * desktop environment detection and GUI dialog frontends (zenity, kdialog,
    yad, tkinter, tty) replaced by a terminal user interface built with
    Bubble Tea;
  * network configuration refactored behind a backend interface, with
    NetworkManager (D-Bus), iwd and wpa_supplicant implementations;
  * Python runtime dependencies dropped: dbus-python replaced by the pure-Go
    godbus/dbus, and the cryptography / pyOpenSSL modules replaced by the
    pure-Go go-pkcs12 (the openssl CLI is only an optional fallback);
  * assorted fixes (NetworkManager version detection, iwd file handling,
    wpa_supplicant EAP-TLS key path, quoting of configuration values).

These modifications are not endorsed by GÉANT, GEANT Limited, GÉANT
Vereniging (Association), the University of Göttingen, GWDG or any of the
original authors or contributors.


