INSTITUTION PROFILE DATA
------------------------

The institution profile (internal/profile), including the embedded CA
certificate "GWDG eduroam CA" (internal/profile/ca.pem), the RADIUS server
names and the support contact details, originates from the CAT-generated
installer for the University of Göttingen.


